{"parse": {"title": "The Ice Queen Portal", "pageid": 2220, "revid": 17375, "text": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><p><b>Ice Queen's</b> is a Secret Portal drop by doing the frozen portal which is currently unobtainable after the Christmas event has ended.\n</p><p><b>Ice Queen's Portal</b> can obtained by the following:\n</p>\n<table class=\"mw-collapsible fandom-table\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>Required Items:\n</td>\n<td>Frozen Portals\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Result\n</td>\n<td>Ice Queen's portal (Not Guaranteed From Every Frozen Portal)\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<ul><li>The Drop Chance in a Ice Queen's Portal is 100% for the host and 5% for the other players in the portal</li>\n<li>The portal Drops a <i><b>Secret</b></i> unit \"<a href=\"/wiki/Ice_Queen\" title=\"Ice Queen\">Ice Queen</a>\" Which can be later evolved to\"<a href=\"/wiki/Ice_Queen_(Empire%27s_Strongest)\" title=\"Ice Queen (Empire&#39;s Strongest)\">Ice Queen (Empires strongest)</a>\"</li>\n<li class=\"mw-empty-elt\"></li></ul>\n<p><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/animeadventures/images/8/81/Ice_queens_portal.png/revision/latest?cb=20230524023422\" class=\"mw-file-description image\"><img alt=\"Ice queens portal\" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/animeadventures/images/8/81/Ice_queens_portal.png/revision/latest?cb=20230524023422\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"50\" height=\"50\" class=\"mw-file-element\" data-image-name=\"Ice queens portal.png\" data-image-key=\"Ice_queens_portal.png\" data-relevant=\"0\" /></a></span>\n</p>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20261023132533\nCache expiry: 2592000\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: []\nCPU time usage: 0.009 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.012 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 1/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 0/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 0/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 1/100\nExpensive parser